OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, the rain occasionally heavy.
OL,7,FSome drier and brighter spells
OL,8,Fpossible, the best of these across
OL,9,FEast Lothian and the eastern Borders.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain this
OL,12,Fevening, perhaps heavy and thundery at
OL,13,Ffirst. The rain should clear by
OL,14,Fmidnight with well broken cloud and
OL,15,Frather chilly by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells, but cloud building with
OL,19,Foccasional heavy showers. Drier and
OL,20,Fbrighter again later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
